    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olaiguanani Yoash le Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa to lari liopishana le nkitoria e Yehu, neiteru Yehoash aitoreisho, neitoreisho ninye ilarin artam oare te Yerusalem. Ore apa enkarna e ng'otonye naa keji Sibia e Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas Yehoash mbaa sidain too nkonyek o Laitoriani too nkolong'i enyena pooki, amu eiteng'ena apa olapolosani Yehoida ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia eitu apa eiwuang'ieki iwuejitin neeika, metaa eshomo iltung'ana dukuya epolosisho nepej enkorropil too wuejitin neeika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.11+EXO.30.12+EXO.30.13+EXO.30.14+EXO.30.15+EXO.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 30.11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Yehoash lelo apolosak, “Ore kuna pisai pooki oo ntokitin sinyat naayawuaki atua enkaji o Laitoriani, nena pisai naaikenakaki pooki ng'ae - nena pisai naaikenakaki iltung'ana pooki, o nena pisai naadumaki oltau oltung'ani meyau atua enkaji o Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchoo ilapolosak eya, eya ake oltung'ani te lelo ooyiolo. Naa nchoo ninche eitobir ina aji aaram te nkata ake naba anaa enadoli ewueji nerami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore to lari le tikitam ookuni le nkitoria o laiguanani Yehoash, neitu eram ilapolosak ina aji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, neipotu olaiguanani Yehoash Yehoida olapolosani o kulikae apolosak nejoki ninche, Kainyoo intae pee mintobiriri enkaji aaram? Ore naa taata mintokiki aaya mpesai te lelo liyiolorere, kake enchooi nena pisai pee eitobirieki enkaji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyorraa lelo apolosak pee meitoki aaya kulie pisai too ltung'ana, nemeitobir ninche aaram ina aji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yehoida ilo apolosani adumu osanduku, nepik enaudoto enkikenet enye, nepik ilo sanduku embata o lperere lo lasar, te nkalo e tatene, te wueji nejing'ieki enkaji o Laitoriani; ore lelo apolosak oorip kutukaji nepik atua ine nena pisai pooki naayawuaki atua enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ake enkata nadoli aajo aikumok mpisai naatii atua ilo sanduku, nelotu olasirani lo laiguanani o lapolosani kitok, aaiken neenaa ninche too lbenia oo notoki tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho ninche nena pisai naaidipaki aaikena lelo aasak le siaai ooitasheiki enkaji o Laitoriani; nelaaki ninche lelo aguetak loo nkeek, o lashetak ooshetita ina aji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho sii ilashetak loo soito o ladung'ok loo soito. Neinyiang'u sii mbaoi o soito ooitobirieki enkaji o Laitoriani aaram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu eishoori te nkaraki enkaji o Laitoriani ntokitin naaitobirieki, ngirran e nkosholai, o ntokitin naarieki enkima, o lbakulini, o ntarumpetani, anaa kulie masaa e sahabu, arashu ine nkosholai, te nena pisai apa naayawuaki atua enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eishooki apa nena pisai ilaitobirak le nkaji ooramita enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.22.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 22.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitu apa eikilikuani metolimu enkikenakinoto te lelo tung'ana ooishooitie nena pisai too nkaik enye, aalaaki lelo aisiaayiak, amu etaasishote apa ninche te nkoitoi naisiligayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 7.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore mpisai o lasar le nkitarruorroto o no lasar le ng'oki, neitu eyauni atua enkaji o Laitoriani; inoo lapolosak nena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa teina kata nelo Hasael olaiguanani le Siria aarare Gaat, neya ninye. Kake ore ake pee eibelekenya Hasael aing'or Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neya Yehoash ilo aiguanani le Yuda nena kishorot pooki apa naaitisinya, Yehoshafat o Yoram o Ahasia, lelo aiguanak apa le Yuda, oara iloo menye. O nena kishorot naaitisinya ninye makewan, o sahabu pooki apa natii atua ilchumat le nkaji o Laitoriani, o enkaji o laiguanani neirriwaki nena pooki Hasael olaiguanani le Siria. Nelo Hasael aing'uaa Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa kulie kiaasin e Yoash, o nena pooki naataasa, neigeroki tiatua embuku oo ntepen oo laiguanak le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye isinkan lenyena aarreshisho, near Yoash metua te nkaji e Milo teina oitoi nadoyio alo Sila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isinkan lenyena apa, Yasakar olayioni le Shimet o Yehoshad olayioni le Shomer ootanang'ie ninye enkop, neaku etua ninye nenukari tenebo loo menye tiatua enkanasa e Daudi, neitoreisho Amasia olayioni lenye te rishata enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
